IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0002.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0002C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 EFFECTIVE-RATE     PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2500-SENIOR-RATE
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "EFFECTIVE-RATE=" EFFECTIVE-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2500-SENIOR-RATE.
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 55 AND CURR-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO EFFECTIVE-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'F'
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = EFFECTIVE-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
